# Only what the cloud binary builds from; the rest of the repository
# (apps, packages, docs, caches) stays out of the build context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!docs/Cargo.toml
!docs/src/lib.rs
!platforms/dart/rust/
!services/cloud/
# Workspace members outside crates/: Cargo reads their manifests even when
# it builds only canvist_cloud.
!services/dictation/
!examples/desktop/
!tools/footage/
**/target/
**/node_modules/
